+# A tool name that cannot be a real tool-call name: prose the model wrote
+# after a stray tool-call opener. OpenAI tool names match
+# [A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}; anything else that reaches a name slot is a phantom.
+_PHANTOM_NAME_RE = re.compile(r"^[A-Za-z0-9_.\-]{1,128}$")
+
